      "budget_share": 0.85,
      "why": "Only family that can plausibly reach 50 MSPS. k=2..8 covers the Fmax vs cycles/result trade-off; N=12..24 covers accuracy vs cycles; W=14..20 covers output quantization vs area; guards and rounding let Optuna find the minimum-power point that still meets max_abs_err <= 2^-12."
    },
    {
      "family": "iterative",
      "ranges": [
        {
          "param": "data_width",
          "low": 14,
          "high": 20,
          "choices": null
        },
        {
          "param": "n_iter",
          "low": 12,
